ph","text":"そして２日目には\n色々なCDショップさんへ挨拶をさせていただきました♪(o・ω・)ノ))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"店員さんとお話したり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポスターにサインをしたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真を撮ったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メッセージカードを書いたりしてきましたー( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お邪魔しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近くに行ったら探してみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、２日目の最後には\nなんと初体験のビリヤードをやってきたんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。遊んでた訳じゃないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"取材なのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"THE真剣な感じね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全く入らないかと思ったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナインゲームでは最後もばっちり決めて勝ったよヽ(^ω^)ﾉわーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビリヤードアイドルとして\nあみと活動しようかと\n真剣に考えたのよ(´･-･`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩みの種"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆーことでね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっんとに充実した２日間を過ごしてきたよ＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は牧場とか、旭山動物園とか行ってみたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のメンバー紹介は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりこの人でしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみ。(๑•ૅω•´๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみとは最近仲良くて結構一緒にいる時間多いかもなーヽ(^0^)ﾉ\n最近メンバーの中であみに似てると\n噂されるようになってきたのも\n最近になってからで笑\n影響されてるみたいよ(´Д` )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってこんなに面白くて場を明るく笑いに包ませる人なんて\nあみが初めてだとおもう！\n無意識に、人を笑顔にさせるあみに憧れたのかもしれない(^^)/\nあみ、最初はすごい人見知りで話しかけづらい感じで喋れなかったの。\n意外でしょ？笑\nだけど今はこんなだし人ってわかんないねー(´Д` )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はこんなんでもあみダンスとかすごい上手だしかっこいいよ！\n人知れず隠れて努力してるんだなーって思った(*´ω`*)\nくぅぅぅぅかっこいいぜ\nあみみたいになりたいかも！笑\n大好きやー(๑•ૅω•´๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わりっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ収録ねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよ楽しかった(  ；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木メンほんとすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/4719329/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またねん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´>∀<｀)ゝ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-42081":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"週間プレイボーイさんで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆとじゅんなと男装やりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまは、今回は可愛いあざといおとこのこをイメージしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/12/09/8890262/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装は、クールだけやるんじゃなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Free!はまこちゃん推しだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コスプレするなら渚きゅんなのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体型に合うキャラクターになり、大好きなキャラの名前を呼ぶのですね(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクは涙袋にキラキラのピンクのラメを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リップもマットなピンクを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもおとこのこらしく(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆもじゅんなもイケメンですやろ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第2弾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってますよ？？？え？？？(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/12/09/8890262/0